## Development

```bash
# Run tests
pytest tests/ -v

# By category
pytest tests/unit/ -v        # Unit tests (fast)
pytest tests/server/ -v      # Integration tests
pytest tests/selenium/ -v    # Browser tests

# With coverage
pytest --cov=potato --cov-report=html
```

